{"id":"n49639-2-8","stage":5,"title":"들여오다 · 买来","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49639-2-8-1","ko":"우리 집도 냉장고 하나 새로 들여와요.","zh":"我们家也要买一台新冰箱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집도","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냉장고","meaning":"冰箱","explanation":"냉장고：冰箱","readings":[{"term":"냉장고","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31524","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉장고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들여와요.","meaning":"买来，引进","explanation":"들여오다：买来，引进；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들여오다","audio":"/audio/f61cc5082bd160d75457.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49639","senseId":"2","lemma":"들여오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"b3bf31f65841d3e1","term":"냉장고","zh":"冰箱","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3","entryId":"31524","definition":"为避免食物坏掉或为了冷却而在低温中进行保管的箱式机器。","pronunciation":["냉ː장고"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"f61cc5082bd160d7","term":"들여오다","zh":"买来，引进","audio":"/audio/f61cc5082bd160d75457.mp3","entryId":"49639","definition":"买进或进口东西。","pronunciation":["드려오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ef8ba9d269966cfb59e4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49639-2-8-2","ko":"지금 있는 냉장고도 아직 쓸 만한데.","zh":"现在用的那台冰箱其实还能用啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"处于，处在","explanation":"있다：处于，处在；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냉장고도","meaning":"冰箱","explanation":"냉장고：冰箱；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"냉장고","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31524","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉장고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓸","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만한데.","meaning":"能","explanation":"만하다：能；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"만하다","audio":"/audio/d24817e6ba3f40d7ae8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53017","senseId":"2","lemma":"만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"处于，处在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"人或动物继续保持某种状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b3bf31f65841d3e1","term":"냉장고","zh":"冰箱","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3","entryId":"31524","definition":"为避免食物坏掉或为了冷却而在低温中进行保管的箱式机器。","pronunciation":["냉ː장고"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"d24817e6ba3f40d7","term":"만하다","zh":"能","audio":"/audio/d24817e6ba3f40d7ae8f.mp3","entryId":"53017","definition":"表示前面内容所指的行动可以做到。","pronunciation":["만하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/292e285d6e058adafbdf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.356,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49639","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在用的那台冰箱其实还能用啊。","智秀的脸是不是有点像那个演员？","我们家也要买一台新冰箱。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["现在用的那台冰箱其实还能用啊。","我们家也要买一台新冰箱。","智秀的脸是不是有点像那个演员？"],"answer":0}]}
